# A project that places its dependencies by name. There is no `path`
# anywhere here: `library` says where the library is, and the package is
# found by the name it declares, two directories down in a category
# folder that is not called what the package is called.
#
# `pulse_edge` is not named below at all. `clock_div` asks for it, and
# the same search places it, which is the half of this that a project
# listing every package by path never had to do.
name library_search
top top
device ice40-hx1k-tq144

source rtl/top.v

library ../../library

depends clock_div ^1.0.0
